      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="container-fluid">

            <h3>請以包含以下欄位的表格試算表（.csv）格式上傳代謝組學資料(Upload Metabolomics in a tabular spreadsheet (.csv) format with the following columns)：</h3>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>sample_name</strong>: 資料庫中已存在的樣本名稱。樣本可來自抽樣試驗、田間試驗或基因分型板。(This should be a sample name that exists in the database. The sample can come from a sampling trial or a field trial or a genotyping plate.)</li>
                <li><strong>device_id</strong>: 用於區分儀器的選填識別碼（例如序號），可為數字或英文字母。(Optional identifier to differentiate device (e.g. serial number). Can be numeric or letter.)</li>
                <li><strong>comments</strong>: 選填備註資訊，可包含測量時特定的樣本製備方式。(Optional comments for any information to include. Can include specific sample preparation for measurement.)</li>
                <li>所有其他欄位為<strong>代謝物名稱(metabolite names)</strong>。您可以新增任意數量的欄位，沒有限制。(All other columns are metabolite names. You can add as many columns as you want to upload, there isn't a limit.)</li>
